==Trivia==
*Most of these treasures' nomenclature consist of natural satellite and a gemstone, e.g. "Phoebe Beryl" is named after [[wikipedia:Phoebe (moon)|Phoebe]], a moon of Saturn, and [[wikipedia:Beryl#Golden beryl and heliodor|Beryl]], a gemstone that has a golden colored variant. The sole exception is "Stellar Garnet" in which Stellar means "star". The only thing connecting it to moons is that moons can be found by [[wikipedia:Occultation#Occultations by the Moon|stellar occultation]], otherwise known as the solar eclipse.
